  "summary": "Implemented owned queue-context cleanup, immutable refcounted source snapshots, bounded scheduling, generation-safe delivery, randomized tests, 1,000 lifecycle cycles, and a macOS TSan path. The runner's sequential clean-worktree execution passed all 16 frozen commands: Debug/ASan/UBSan CTest 10/10, full suite 177/177, and TSan 1/1. Release benchmark: 1,000 cycles in 0.018880 seconds; maximum join 0.000110 seconds; binary 70,288 bytes. The runner rejected the original executor report because its acceptance entries cited commands outside the frozen list; this corrected report cites the exact passing frozen commands. Independent review is pending."
